<p class=3-NormalYaz style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-indent:35.45pt;tab-stops:
35.45pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-hansi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>ğ)
Zeytin için 250 kilogramdan,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3-NormalYaz style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-indent:35.45pt;tab-stops:
35.45pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-hansi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>h)
Zeytinyağı için 250 litreden,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3-NormalYaz style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-indent:35.45pt;tab-stops:
35.45pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-hansi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>ı)
Diğer eşya türleri için gümrüklenmiş değerinin 500.000</span><a
style='mso-footnote-id:ftn5' href="#_ftn5" name="_ftnref5" title=""><span
class=><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-hansi-font-family:"Times New Roman";
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow'><span style='mso-special-character:
